  162: npm run smoke          # play the full-tour demo, assert the end state including both downloaded decks
  163: npm run smoke:integrity # check fixture notices and the split-source warning; local browser only
  164: npm run smoke:workspace # lecturer save/reload/export, guides, keyboard and mobile checks
  165: npm run smoke:curriculum # create/revise/version, evidence receipts and report, real downloads and restore, 320/390px checks
